  "prefLabel": "En 1011.10 Completeness and Compliance Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1011.10 Completeness and Compliance Review. The utility shall review the completed facility as built for compliance with all applicable utility requirements and shall have the option to attend any required commissioning tests pursuant to the currently effective version of IEEE Std 1547™-2018, “IEEE Standard for Interconnection and Interoperability of Distributed Energy Resources with Associated Electric Power Systems Interfaces” dated 4/6/2018 as available in Appendix B. The utility shall conduct the as-built review within 10 business days of receiving the notice of the anticipated in-service date at a time mutually agreeable to the interconnecting customer and utility. If the facility passes the inspection, the utility shall provide written notice of such approval within 3 business days.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
}
